    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ASI101 · Chapter 7 · Session 24</span>\n<h2>Session 24 — 7.7 Final Drive Gears and Bearings7.8 Differential.7.9 Rear Axle Construction.7.10 Types of Rear Axles.7.11 Various Types of Loads Acting o…</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14453 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ASI101 · Chương 7 · Buổi 24</span>\n<h2>Buổi 24 — 7.7 Final Drive Gears and Bearings7.8 Differential.7.9 Rear Axle Construction.7.10 Types of Rear Axles.7.11 Various Types of Loads Acting o…</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14453 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1, CLO2</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">IT</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">Read Slides and  Chapter 7(Main textbook)</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">see session 23</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1, CLO2</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">IT</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">Read Slides and  Chapter 7(Main textbook)</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">xem buổi 23</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>7.7 Final Drive Gears and Bearings7.8 Differential.7.9 Rear Axle Construction.7.10 Types of Rear Axles.7.11 Various Types of Loads Acting on the Rear Axles7.12 Tandem Axle Drive for Heavy Vehicles</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">📑 The slides for this session are in <strong>session 23</strong> (08 Session 23 24 Propeller Shaft, Differential and Rear Axles-[Chapter 7 - MainTextbook]) — the deck covers several sessions.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">📑 Slide của buổi này nằm ở <strong>buổi 23</strong> (08 Session 23 24 Propeller Shaft, Differential and Rear Axles-[Chapter 7 - MainTextbook]) — một deck dùng cho nhiều buổi.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
